    - speaker: 1
      text: i'm just trying to figure out how to get to the windmills haha
    - speaker: 0
      text: just follow the road past Mr. Lawrence's house!
    - speaker: 0
      text: it's the first windmill you see!
    - speaker: 1
      text: oh ok! got it! thanks!
    finishedConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'thank you so much!! '
    acceptAfterNotStartedDialogue: 1
    arrivalConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: welcome, dearest traveler
    - speaker: 0
      text: what makes you come to these parts?
    - speaker: 1
      text: I came here to deliver the seeds you bought from Anna
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'the seeds? '
    deliveredConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: indeed, i remember
    - speaker: 0
      text: well, much thanks to you young traveler!
    - speaker: 1
      text: can i ask what the seeds are for?
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'the seeds you delivered? '
    - speaker: 0
      text: those are the wind seeds of course!
    - speaker: 0
      text: once a year
    - speaker: 0
      text: we plant the wind seeds
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'when they bloom in the spring '
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'they cover the entire valley in beautiful colors '
    - speaker: 0
      text: it is a sight to see for sure!
    - speaker: 0
      text: too bad you missed it to see for yourself
    - speaker: 0
      text: enjoy the flowers here for now then!
    - speaker: 1
      text: oh ok i see!
    - speaker: 1
      text: thats pretty cool!
    - speaker: 0
      text: indeed.
    - speaker: 1
      text: well, if there isn't anything els-
    droppedCargoConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: i don't see many seeds...
    - speaker: 1
      text: oh CRAP
    - speaker: 1
      text: i must've dropped some along the way...
    - speaker: 1
      text: UGHHH...
    - speaker: 0
      text: that's fine traveler
    - speaker: 0
      text: you can be on your w-
    nextDeliveryConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: OH, goodness!
    - speaker: 1
      text: what? what??!
    - speaker: 0
      text: i just realized!
    - speaker: 0
      text: i forgot to give my son Eric food for his hike!
    - speaker: 1
      text: his hike?
    - speaker: 0
      text: yes, Eric has been wanting to hike to the peak
    - speaker: 0
      text: and just yesterday he started the journey up
    - speaker: 0
      text: i don't think he got far without food
    - speaker: 1
      text: that's not good
    - speaker: 0
      text: exactly...
    - speaker: 0
      text: which is why i need your help
    - speaker: 1
      text: my help??
    - speaker: 1
      text: do you see what i'm driving??!
    - speaker: 0
      text: please give my son this backpack with the food and water he needs
    - speaker: 0
      text: i am very forgetful at times...
    - speaker: 1
      text: isn't the roads past here more dangrous?
    - speaker: 1
      text: do you even think this could even handle the roads up there?
    - speaker: 0
      text: well your my only hope
    - speaker: 0
      text: be careful
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'believe in your truck '
    - speaker: 0
      text: i've seen my few share of accidents
    - speaker: 0
      text: remember to stick to the sides of the mountain and don't fall off!
    - speaker: 1
      text: bruh... "don't fall off"
    - speaker: 1
      text: yea Mrs. Carraway
    - speaker: 1
      text: i will try not to...
