  - id: C-E
    objectiveName: food for Eric
    giverVoice: 5
    cargoPrefab: {fileID: 1942898907262164, guid: 95805411afc684e54aebd11e12d7ad5f, type: 3}
    safeCargoAnchor: {fileID: 1207837740943526512}
    cargoSpawnHeight: 1
    droppedDistance: 3
    destroyCargoOnDelivery: 1
    pickupConversation: []
    startedConversation: []
    startedReturnConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: still headed up to Eric?
    - speaker: 1
      text: yep. taking the bends slow.
    finishedConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: thanks for bringing food all this way!
    - speaker: 1
      text: hope the rest of the hike goes well
    acceptAfterNotStartedDialogue: 1
    arrivalConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: hey, hey there!
    - speaker: 0
      text: you made it to my camp, what brings you up here?
    - speaker: 1
      text: your mom sent food and water, Eric
    - speaker: 0
      text: oh, she remembered!
    - speaker: 0
      text: finally! i haven't ate since yesterday!
    - speaker: 0
      text: oh my, you better need to eat then...
    deliveredConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'oh wow, she even packed the good bread! '
    - speaker: 1
      text: she said you might need it up here
    - speaker: 0
      text: well theres one thing she was right about
    - speaker: 0
      text: thanks!
    droppedCargoConversation:
    - speaker: 1
      text: i had your food...
    - speaker: 0
      text: ' but the road got the better of my truck'
    - speaker: 1
      text: i'm sorry Eric
    - speaker: 0
      text: hey
    - speaker: 0
      text: you still came all this way
    - speaker: 0
      text: i saw a fishing rod and a bucket a little big down from here
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'i could just pick that up and use it '
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'it''s ok '
    - speaker: 0
      text: though if you are going up the mounatin
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'i have a odd request '
    nextDeliveryConversation:
    - speaker: 0
      text: also, if you're going a little farther
    - speaker: 0
      text: ... could you take a odd request?
    - speaker: 1
      text: what?
    - speaker: 0
      text: i want to give a prayer to the Doro god to keep me safe
    - speaker: 1
      text: to the what god?
    - speaker: 0
      text: the Doro god
    - speaker: 0
      text: the god that look over this mountain
    - speaker: 0
      text: i don't want the rocks to suddenly drop out beneath my feet you know?
    - speaker: 1
      text: right...
    - speaker: 0
      text: i mean you don't have to at all
    - speaker: 0
      text: i'm just saying if you were gonna keep going anyway
    - speaker: 1
      text: well
    - speaker: 1
      text: i'm here on the mountain already...
    - speaker: 1
      text: i need the fresh air anyway...
    - speaker: 1
      text: 'ok... '
    - speaker: 1
      text: how do i get your prayer to the Doro god?
    - speaker: 0
      text: 'there''s a temple '
    - speaker: 0
      text: at the halfway point of this mountain
    - speaker: 0
      text: just follow the path forward and you will see it
    - speaker: 0
      text: just hand my scroll that has my prayer
    - speaker: 0
      text: to the priest
    - speaker: 1
      text: alright, if it's that easy
    - speaker: 1
      text: i'll do it for you!
    - speaker: 0
      text: really?
    - speaker: 0
      text: thank you so much!
    - speaker: 0
      text: stay safe though
    - speaker: 1
      text: you too!
    - speaker: 0
      text: safe travels!
